Warning: the Windows profile registry entry for %1 was left behind.\n\nWindows still holds a profile record for the account just deleted.  If an\naccount called %1 is created again later, Windows honours that record and\ngives it a DIFFERENT home directory - C:\Users\%1 with a suffix added - so\nanything kept in the old one, ssh keys included, will not be found there.\n\nAn administrator can clear it: "Get-CimInstance Win32_UserProfile" from an\nelevated prompt lists the orphaned profile, and "Remove-CimInstance" on the\nentry whose LocalPath is the old home directory removes it.
